 dict(id='xpeng',category='investment',type=['独立公司研究','Independent equity research'],year='2026',name=['小鹏汽车：超越整车的价值','XPeng: Beyond the vehicle'],sub=['存量博弈中的结构红利与物理人工智能的技术兑现','Structural opportunities and physical AI commercialization'],desc=['从行业迁移、全球化和技术变现，走向财务预测、现金流与分部估值。','Connecting industry shifts, globalization and technology monetization with financial forecasts, cash flow and segment valuation.'],cover='xpeng',tags=['26-page report','FCFF / FCFE','SOTP'],files=[('阅读研究报告','Read the research report','xpeng-research.pdf')],sections=[
 ('研究主线','Research question','行业发生了什么变化，为什么这些变化对小鹏相对有利，以及技术优势能否在现金约束下转化为持续利润与可归属的股东价值。','What is changing in the industry, why might those changes favor XPeng, and can its technical advantages become sustainable profit and attributable shareholder value under cash constraints?'),
 ('七章研究框架','Seven-part framework','宏观需求与结构迁移；价格带、利润池与技术路线；技术底座、产品矩阵与组织；全球化与欧洲本地化；整车、Robotaxi、机器人与飞行汽车；盈利修复与商业模式；关键假设、分部估值与风险边界。','Demand and structural shifts; price segments, profit pools and technology routes; technical architecture, products and organization; globalization and European localization; vehicles, Robotaxi, robotics and flying cars; profitability and business models; assumptions, segment valuation and risk boundaries.'),
 ('财务与估值','Financial modeling and valuation','以 2021—2025 年历史合并报表为基础，重点预测 2026—2028 年，并延伸至 2035 年稳态终值；使用相对估值、FCFF、FCFE 和分部估值交叉检验经营假设，区分业务价值、实际持股比例和未来稀释。','Based on 2021–2025 consolidated financial history, the model focuses on 2026–2028 and extends to a 2035 steady state. Relative valuation, FCFF, FCFE and segment valuation cross-check operating assumptions, separating business value, ownership and future dilution.'),
 ('关键跟踪变量','Key monitoring variables','技术授权客户接续、现金消耗、销量与产能利用率、自动驾驶监管、产品结构和新业务量产。报告中的估值是经营假设检验，并非正式目标价。','Follow-on technology customers, cash consumption, sales and capacity utilization, autonomous-driving regulation, product mix and new-business production. Valuation outputs test assumptions and are not formal price targets.')]),
