 ('核心研究判断','Core research findings','国产算力市场已从“建设驱动”转向“消纳与场景驱动”；Agent 工作流抬高 CPU 权重。研究关注芯片、云端趋势、产业链与 AI 商业化之间的联系。','The research identified a shift in domestic AI computing demand from construction-led investment toward utilization and use cases. Agent workflows raise the relative importance of CPUs. The analysis connects chips, cloud trends, the value chain and AI commercialization.'),
